WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.648
Water is entering a lower level in this practice scene.

00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:07.363
If you are trapped by flooding, go to the highest level.

00:00:07.363 --> 00:00:09.552
Do not climb into a closed attic.

00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:11.741
Stairs may not work for everyone.

00:00:11.741 --> 00:00:13.797
Plan extra help before a storm.

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:16.848
This app cannot promise that help will arrive.
